WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.762
Week 7: Questions and High-Frequency Irregulars. request specific information state ability and intention repair a misunderstanding

2
00:00:08.762 --> 00:00:22.327
Operational objective. By the end of this section you can request specific information, state ability and intention, repair a misunderstanding. The focus is useful performance, not isolated terminology.

3
00:00:22.327 --> 00:00:30.470
Language system. Question formation; interrogatives; ir, tener, hacer, venir, decir, poder, querer, and saber.

4
00:00:30.470 --> 00:00:37.696
Sound and delivery. Question intonation and the difference between informational and confirmation questions.

5
00:00:37.696 --> 00:00:46.866
Core principle. Notice meaning first, then form. Retrieve the new language aloud, compare it with the model, and repair one feature at a time.

6
00:00:46.866 --> 00:01:06.831
Model language. ¿Qué quiere hacer hoy? — What do you want to do today? ¿Cuándo viene el autobús? — When does the bus come? No sé; ¿puede repetirlo? — I don't know; can you repeat that? Tengo que hacer una llamada. — I have to make a call. ¿Por qué dices eso? — Why do you say that?

7
00:01:06.831 --> 00:01:16.579
Check your readiness. Explain the core idea. Produce an original example. Complete the section assessment at 85% or higher.
